
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>KAZI JOB WEBSITE</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f6fb;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: #073b75;
      color: white;
      padding: 24px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; }
    nav {
      background: #052b55;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .hero {
      background: #dceaff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 45px 16px;
    }
    .hero h2 { color: #073b75; font-size: 30px; }
    .container {
      max-width: 950px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card, .about, .form-box {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #00000012;
    }
    .jobs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #087443;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    label { display: block; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 14px; }
    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-top: 5px;
      border: 1px solid #bbb;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font: inherit;
    }
    textarea { min-height: 100px; }
    .notice { color: #8a3d00; font-size: 14px; }
    footer {
      background: #052b55;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>KAZI JOB WEBSITE</h1>
  <p>Discover opportunities. Build your future.</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#jobs">Jobs</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#apply">Apply</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <h2>Find Your Next Job</h2>
  <p>Explore job opportunities and take the next step in your career.</p>
  <a class="button" href="#jobs">Explore Jobs</a>
</section>

<main class="container">
  <section id="jobs">
    <h2>Featured Jobs</h2>
    <div class="jobs">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>ICT Support Assistant</h3>
        <p><strong>Category:</strong> Information Technology</p>
        <p>Assist with computers, software and basic networking.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#apply">Apply</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Sales Assistant</h3>
        <p><strong>Category:</strong> Sales</p>
        <p>Help customers and support daily sales activities.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#apply">Apply</a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Office Assistant</h3>
        <p><strong>Category:</strong> Administration</p>
        <p>Support office operations and organize documents.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#apply">Apply</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="notice">These are sample listings for demonstration, not verified vacancies.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>KAZI JOB WEBSITE aims to help people discover job opportunities in one place.</p>
    <p>Always confirm a vacancy with the employer. Never pay someone who promises to guarantee you a job.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="apply">
    <h2>Apply for a Job</h2>
    <div class="form-box">
      <p>Fill in your details to express your interest in a job.</p>

      <form id="applicationForm">
        <label for="applicantName">Full Name</label>
        <input id="applicantName" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Enter your full name" required>

        <label for="applicantEmail">Email Address</label>
        <input id="applicantEmail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>

        <label for="jobChoice">Choose a Job</label>
        <select id="jobChoice" name="job" required>
          <option value="">-- Select a job --</option>
          <option>ICT Support Assistant</option>
          <option>Sales Assistant</option>
          <option>Office Assistant</option>
        </select>

        <label for="applicantMessage">Why are you interested?</label>
        <textarea id="applicantMessage" name="message" placeholder="Write a short message" required></textarea>

        <p><button class="button" type="submit">Submit Application</button></p>
      </form>
      <p id="formMessage" role="status"></p>
      <p class="notice">Demo only: this form does not send or save applications yet.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about" id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Contact details will be added here soon.</p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 KAZI JOB WEBSITE. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

<script>
  document.getElementById("applicationForm").addEventListener("submit", function(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
    document.getElementById("formMessage").textContent =
      "Thank you! The form is working as a demo, but your application has not been sent or saved.";
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
